WEBVTT

00:12:28.276 --> 00:12:31.436
that he watched as a procession
of 40,000 people

00:12:31.476 --> 00:12:34.356
emerged from a nearby forest.

00:12:34.396 --> 00:12:38.436
They had been walking for 48 hours
to flee a military attack.

00:12:38.476 --> 00:12:40.356
And among them was an old man.

00:12:41.396 --> 00:12:43.516
He was dazed and exhausted.

00:12:44.356 --> 00:12:46.396
And he asked Allan Little,

00:12:46.436 --> 00:12:47.916
"Have you seen my wife,

00:12:47.916 --> 00:12:49.436
we got separated in the forest,

00:12:49.476 --> 00:12:51.836
I don't know whether she's made it."

00:12:52.916 --> 00:12:55.116
And Little said to him,

00:12:55.156 --> 00:12:59.116
"Do you mind if I ask you,
are you a Muslim or a Croat?"